v 3
d 'PLUMBCHAIN': module to audit every step of a multi-stage data pipeline
d
d plumbchain runs plumber on consecutive pipeline stages (1->2, 2->3, ...)
d or, with the baseline option, on the first stage against every later
d stage, and stacks the audit tables with step and stage identifiers.
d
d KW: data management
d KW: audit
d KW: pipeline
d
d Requires: Stata version 14 and the plumber package
d   net install plumber, from("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codeatcodecto/plumber/main/")
d
d Author: Brian W. Mandikiana, SESRI, Qatar University
d Support: email bwmandikiana@gmail.com
d Support: https://github.com/codeatcodecto/plumber/issues
d License: MIT
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261126
d
f plumbchain.ado
f plumbchain.sthlp
